{"id":"vod_bf_26046","vodId":"26046","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"平稳世代的韦驮天们","name_cn":"平稳世代的韦驮天们","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-27/d997c233923c931d0e4eaec3cc4088a3.jpg"},"summary":"“韦驮天” × “魔族” × “人类”，世人无从知晓的禁断大逃杀现在开始——　　经过一番壮烈的战斗，以压倒性的速度与强大而自豪的战斗诸神“韦驮天”封印了导致世界毁灭的“魔族”，自那以后过了800年。如今，“那场战斗”不过是遥远神话当中的传说故事而已。从出生起一次都没有战斗过的“平稳世代的韦驮天们”享受着安逸的生活，此时不知何人让魔族从漫长的沉睡当中再度复活了——武力、智略、政治、阴谋，总之只要是能用上的东西不论什么都拿出来吧！无规则＆无限制的三方大逃杀现在开始！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:20:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/pingwenshidaideweituotianmen/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:19.072Z"}